# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://rangka-os.github.io/rangka-os/schema/0.5/module.json
name: whatsapp_reminder
version: 1.0.0
title: {id: Pengingat tagihan lewat WhatsApp, en: WhatsApp payment reminders}
summary:
  id: Faktur yang lewat jatuh tempo dan belum lunas diingatkan ke pelanggan lewat WhatsApp, paling banyak tiga kali.
  en: Overdue unpaid invoices are reminded to the customer on WhatsApp, at most three times.
category: sales
icon: send-plane-line
# One message type of the WhatsApp service (module whatsapp): installing this module is switching "Pengingat tagihan"
# on. Every morning at 09.00 the flow reminds each customer of an overdue invoice with `pengingat_jatuh_tempo`, once
# per step: step 1 from 1 day late, step 2 from 7 days, step 3 from 14 days; a day the server missed is caught up the
# next morning, and no step is sent twice. Each reminder is also an invoice_reminder row (channel WhatsApp) on the
# invoice, next to the reminders staff send by hand.
requires: {rangka: '>=0.5', users: ^1.0, contacts: ^1.3, invoicing: ^1.0, whatsapp: ^1.0}
